 "insight": [
  "Each year from 2005 to 2025, Belgium supplied a significant share of Luxembourg's fuel imports, starting at 59.5% in 2005 and decreasing to 50.3% in 2025.",
  "The median share over this period was 55.5%, with the highest share recorded in 2011 at 66.3%.",
  "The largest year-to-year increase occurred between 2009 and 2010, rising from 55.5% to 65.2%.",
  "The lowest share was in 2022 at 43.8%, and the share in 2024 was 49.8%.",
  "These values are nominal and not adjusted for price changes, which may affect comparisons over time."
 ],
